        <item>
            <title>0.23.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 10 Oct 2026 21:45:57 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
            <sparkle:version>44</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.23.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.23.1</h3><ul><li>Keeploop's first public release.</li><li>Ask your AI about your Mac's Mail, Calendar, Messages, Notes, Contacts and Slack. Your data stays on your Mac.</li><li>Works with Claude, ChatGPT, Codex, Cursor and other AI apps, on your Mac and on the web and phone.</li><li>Cards in ChatGPT and Claude show your inbox, today's schedule, free time and drafts.</li><li>Monitors tell you when a reply, a signature or an invite arrives.</li><li>Drafts and replies in your voice, and every send follows your rules: Blocked, Asked or Auto per account, label and contact.</li><li>You choose which accounts and sources each AI app can see.</li><li>One-time and sign-in codes are hidden from web and phone AI apps.</li><li>Optional health reports, off by default, and Report a problem.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/keeploopapp/releases/releases/download/v0.23.1/Keeploop-0.23.1.dmg" length="44533780" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="559y73XqfAryxGTkDmxEBkuehoIqmDkW5uP/Monb6k4h9hv8arH7pezrxAnkaLw50J7vqWb88ul6J3nRn3pWCw=="/>
        </item>
